  (text "Analog front end: ADS1298, 2.048 MHz clock, input filters, electrode connectors"
    (at 20 25 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 2.5 2.5))
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "567a579a-da57-532d-bd8c-6da3be32db27")
  )
  (text "ADS1298 runs unipolar: AVDD = +3V0 (LP5907), DVDD = +3V3, VREF = 2.4 V internal.\nClock: external 2.048 MHz +/-20 ppm (CLKSEL = 0) -> f_s = 1000.00 Hz exactly (DR = 101, HR mode).\nChannel n: pod buffer -> 2.2k + 1n (CM) / 10n (DM) EMI filter -> INnP/INnN, PGA gain 6,\nrange +/-400 mV, 1 LSB = 47.7 nV. Right-leg drive: RLDOUT -> 100k -> bias electrode."
    (at 20 554 0)
    (effects
      (font (size 1.5 1.5))
      (justify left bottom)
    )
    (uuid "d7204f4c-7d7a-5ea0-80bc-724be50599f8")
  )
)
